Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pve-wdcbalancer
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 9.0),
         pve-ha-manager,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${perl:Depends},
Description: Cluster load balancing for Proxmox VE (vSphere DRS-style)
 Scores every guest by how much of its CPU and memory demand it gets,
 balances the cluster by live migration recommendations, and enforces VM
 groups, host groups and VM/Host and VM-VM rules, with automation levels,
 a migration threshold and per-VM overrides. Adds a REST API under
 /nodes/{node}/wdcbalancer, the 'wdcbalancer' CLI and a Datacenter >
 Load Balancing panel in the web GUI.
